    "work_id": "oglt-pl/augustinus/pl47_2_unk",
    "canonical_ref": "PL47.UNK.s10",
    "language": "lat",
    "text": "et ipse erit mihi in filium, et misericordiam meam non auferam ab eo, sicut abstuli ab eo qui ante te futi;",
    "chunk_index": 9,
    "context_before": null,
    "context_after": null,
    "date_composed": 408,
    "date_range": [
      386,
      430
    ],
    "date_confidence": "approximate",
    "out_of_period": false,
    "translation_group_id": null
  },
  {
    "chunk_id": "oglt-pl/augustinus/pl47_2_unk#PL47.UNK.s11",
    "work_id": "oglt-pl/augustinus/pl47_2_unk",
    "canonical_ref": "PL47.UNK.s11",
    "language": "lat",
    "text": "et statuam eum in domo mea, et in regno meo usque in sempiternum, et thronum meum firmissimum in perpe- tuum,",
    "chunk_index": 10,
    "context_before": null,
    "context_after": null,
    "date_composed": 408,
    "date_range": [
      386,
      430
    ],
    "date_confidence": "approximate",
    "out_of_period": false,
    "translation_group_id": null
  },
  {
    "chunk_id": "oglt-pl/augustinus/pl47_2_unk#PL47.UNK.s12",
    "work_id": "oglt-pl/augustinus/pl47_2_unk",
    "canonical_ref": "PL47.UNK.s12",
    "language": "lat",
    "text": "Hæc omnia qui in Salomone putat fuisse im- pleta, multum errare videtur; nam qualiter in Salo- mone intelligendum est quod dictum est :",
    "chunk_index": 11,
    "context_before": null,
    "context_after": null,
    "date_composed": 408,
    "date_range": [
      386,
      430
    ],
    "date_confidence": "approximate",
    "out_of_period": false,
    "translation_group_id": null
  },
  {
    "chunk_id": "oglt-pl/augustinus/pl47_2_unk#PL47.UNK.s13",
    "work_id": "oglt-pl/augustinus/pl47_2_unk",
    "canonical_ref": "PL47.UNK.s13",
    "language": "lat",
    "text": "Postquam dormieris cum patribus tuis, suscitabo semen tuum post te, quod erit de filiis tuis, et stabiliam regnum ejus?",
    "chunk_index": 12,
    "context_before": null,
    "context_after": null,
    "date_composed": 408,
    "date_range": [
      386,
      430
    ],
    "date_confidence": "approximate",
    "out_of_period": false,
    "translation_group_id": null
  },
  {
    "chunk_id": "oglt-pl/augustinus/pl47_2_unk#PL47.UNK.s14",
    "work_id": "oglt-pl/augustinus/pl47_2_unk",
    "canonical_ref": "PL47.UNK.s14",
    "language": "lat",
    "text": "Nunquid de ille Salomone creditur propheta- tum? Minime; ille enim vivente patre suo cœpit regnare;",
    "chunk_index": 13,
    "context_before": null,
    "context_after": null,
    "date_composed": 408,
    "date_range": [
      386,
      430
    ],
    "date_confidence": "approximate",
    "out_of_period": false,
    "translation_group_id": null
  },
  {
    "chunk_id": "oglt-pl/augustinus/pl47_2_unk#PL47.UNK.s15",
    "work_id": "oglt-pl/augustinus/pl47_2_unk",
    "canonical_ref": "PL47.UNK.s15",
    "language": "lat",
    "text": "nam hic dicitur : quia cum impleti fuerint dies tui et dormieris cum patribus tuis, suscitabo semen tuum,",
    "chunk_index": 14,
    "context_before": null,
    "context_after": null,
    "date_composed": 408,
    "date_range": [
      386,
      430
    ],
